UnitAerodromeMigration::ClaimIncentives
├── when a reward token is the migration output token
│   ├── it should revert with InvalidRewardToken
│   └── it should leave the migration and recipient balances unchanged
├── when the same reward token is claimed for different reward contracts
│   └── it should transfer the claimed token balance once
└── given the claimed token balance is positive
    └── it should transfer the claimed token balance
